error[E0189]: Product.Name: ui.Spec's Required is the message of a required field, and is empty
  --> err_formspec.vuka:10:67
   |
10 |     Name   string @orm.Char{Max: 100, Min: 2, Unique: true} @ui.Spec{Required: "", Msg: ui.Msgs{"uniq": "Taken"}}
   |                                                                      ^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: write its message, Required: "Enter a name", or @ui.Required for the default one

error[E0189]: Product.Name: ui.Spec's Msg "uniq" names no rule
  --> err_formspec.vuka:10:94
   |
10 |     Name   string @orm.Char{Max: 100, Min: 2, Unique: true} @ui.Spec{Required: "", Msg: ui.Msgs{"uniq": "Taken"}}
   |                                                                                                 ^
   |
   = help: did you mean "unique"? the rules are required, min, max, len, pattern, oneof, choice, email, unique, number, whole, format, digits, file

error[E0189]: Product.Status: ui.Spec has Required and Optional: a field is one or the other
  --> err_formspec.vuka:11:93
   |
11 |     Status string @orm.Char{Choices: []string{"draft", "live"}} @ui.Spec{Required: "Pick one", Optional: true}
   |                                                                                                ^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: drop one of them

error[E0183]: Product.Code's label is set by its tag (label) and by @ui.Spec: a setting has one source
  --> err_formspec.vuka:12:30
   |
12 |     Code   string `label:"SKU"` @ui.Spec{Label: "Code", Max: 20} @ui.Max(10)
   |                                 ^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: drop it from the tag, or drop the attribute

error[E0183]: Product.Code's max is set by @ui.Spec and by @ui.Max: a setting has one source
  --> err_formspec.vuka:12:63
   |
12 |     Code   string `label:"SKU"` @ui.Spec{Label: "Code", Max: 20} @ui.Max(10)
   |                                                                  ^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: keep one of them: a ui.Spec's member, or the single attribute

error[E0183]: Product.Note's placeholder is set by @ui.Placeholder and by @ui.Spec: a setting has one source
  --> err_formspec.vuka:13:48
   |
13 |     Note   string @ui.Placeholder("e.g. Fragile") @ui.Spec{Placeholder: "Handle with care", Msg: ui.Msgs{"max": "Too long"}} @ui.Msg("max", "Shorter")
   |                                                   ^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: keep one of them: a ui.Spec's member, or the single attribute

error[E0183]: Product.Note's message for max is set by @ui.Spec and by @ui.Msg: a setting has one source
  --> err_formspec.vuka:13:123
   |
13 |     Note   string @ui.Placeholder("e.g. Fragile") @ui.Spec{Placeholder: "Handle with care", Msg: ui.Msgs{"max": "Too long"}} @ui.Msg("max", "Shorter")
   |                                                                                                                              ^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: keep one of them: a ui.Spec's member, or the single attribute

error[E0189]: ProductForm.Name: ui.Spec's Max 120 is above the model's 100: a form may tighten a field's limits, not loosen them
  --> err_formspec.vuka:18:26
   |
18 |     Name   ui.Meta @ui.Spec{Max: 120, Min: 1}
   |                             ^^^
   |
   = help: write a Max of 100 or less, or raise the model's

error[E0189]: ProductForm.Name: ui.Spec's Min 1 is below the model's 2: a form may tighten a field's limits, not loosen them
  --> err_formspec.vuka:18:36
   |
18 |     Name   ui.Meta @ui.Spec{Max: 120, Min: 1}
   |                                       ^^^
   |
   = help: write a Min of 2 or more, or lower the model's

error[E0189]: ProductForm.Status: ui.Spec's choice "gone" isn't one of the model's: a form may narrow a field's choices, not add to them
  --> err_formspec.vuka:19:26
   |
19 |     Status ui.Meta @ui.Spec{Choices: []string{"draft", "gone"}}
   |                             ^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: the model's choices are draft, live

error[E0190]: ProductForm.Nmae is a ui.Meta describing Product's field of the same name, and Product has no field Nmae; did you mean Name?
  --> err_formspec.vuka:20:2
   |
20 |     Nmae   ui.Meta
   |     ^^^^
   |
   = help: name the member as Product's field: Name ui.Meta

error[E0190]: Stray.Name is a ui.Meta, which describes a field of a form type's T, and Stray embeds no ui.FormFor
  --> err_formspec.vuka:24:2
   |
24 |     Name ui.Meta
   |     ^^^^
   |
   = help: embed ui.FormFor[T] in Stray, or give Name a type

Some errors have detailed explanations: E0183, E0189, E0190.
For more information about an error, try `vuka explain E0183`.
